	(text "HV WARNING: 288-403 V DC is lethal. Bench-test behind an isolation transformer, current-limited. Do not defeat Leaf contactors/interlocks/BMS." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 8 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "ebe0e581-44da-43ff-922d-8c1b1f95a938"))
	(text "Controller on the 14 V side; primary FETs via UCC21520 isolated drivers; 15 V primary bias from isolated module U6." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 12 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "f348b28b-3849-43f9-983b-736e70f0852f"))
	(text "Start-up: 12 V on J2 boots the ESP32; afterwards D4 keeps it alive from the output. Drivers are disabled by default (DRV_DIS pulled high)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 16 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "bf386a70-d029-4c63-a63e-c35344e534d2"))
	(text "Hardware OCP: U8 compares ISENSE with IREF (~1.8 V = ~45 A); fault pulls EN_G low through D5, switching Q8 off, so DRV_DIS goes high. MCU also reads OCP_N." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "26e7e4cb-3a8f-4912-8ce2-3ad884028fdc"))
